{%- comment -%}
  True Tribute — "Upload your photo" on a product page, and the notice that
  a design is ready on every page (public/true-tribute-try.js).

  INSTALL (Online Store → Themes → ⋯ → Duplicate the live theme first, and
  work on the copy until it is tested):
  1. The script itself is served by the tool (public/true-tribute-try.js),
     so changes to it go live with the tool, with no theme change.
  2. Edit code → Snippets → Add a new snippet "true-tribute-try", paste this file.
  3. In the product template (Customize → Product → Add block → Custom
     Liquid, above "Buy buttons"), add:   {% render 'true-tribute-try', product: product %}
     On the "new-product" template, whose Newproduct section takes no
     blocks, add a Custom Liquid section instead: the script moves the
     button to just above Add to Cart / Buy Now.
  4. In the footer (Customize → Footer → Add section → Custom Liquid), add:
     {% render 'true-tribute-try', footer: true %}   so a design being made
     carries on, and its notice shows, on every page.
  5. Preview a photo product, try it end to end, then publish the copy.

  The button only shows on the photo products the tool knows
  (lib/shop-products.ts); every other product looks exactly as before.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign tt_products = 'photo-dollar,halfsize-photo-pendant,fullsize-photo-pendant,couple-photo-pendant,family-photo-pendant,pet-pendant,round-shape-photo-pendant,oval-shape-photo-pendant,vertical-oval-shape-photo-pendant,heart-shape-photo-pendant,full-size-heart-pendant,octaganol-shape-pendant,bar-pendant' | split: ','
-%}

{%- if product and footer != true and tt_products contains product.handle -%}
  <div class="tt-try" data-handle="{{ product.handle }}" data-title="{{ product.title | escape }}">
    <script type="application/json" data-tt-variants>
      [{%- for v in product.variants -%}{"id": {{ v.id }}, "title": {{ v.title | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}]
    </script>
    <button type="button" class="tt-try__button button button--full-width" data-tt-open>
      Upload your photo &amp; see your pendant
    </button>
    <p class="tt-try__note" data-tt-note hidden></p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
<div hidden data-tt-tool="https://true-b.vercel.app"></div>
<style>
  .tt-try { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .tt-try__note { margin: .6rem 0 0; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #166534; }
  .tt-try__overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2147483000; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .55); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .tt-try__overlay[hidden] { display: none; }
  .tt-try__frame { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; background: #fff; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .tt-try__frame { width: 480px; height: 560px; max-height: 92vh; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3); transition: height .2s ease; } }
  .tt-toast { position: fixed; right: 16px; bottom: 96px; z-index: 2147482999; width: min(340px, calc(100vw - 32px)); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; background: #fff; color: #0f172a; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, .25); cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .tt-toast[hidden] { display: none; }
  .tt-toast__img { width: 56px; height: 56px; flex: none; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 10px; background: #f8fafc; }
  .tt-toast__spin { width: 28px; height: 28px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid #e2e8f0; border-top-color: #a78bfa; animation: tt-spin 1s linear infinite; }
  .tt-toast__text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
  .tt-toast__text span { color: #64748b; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .tt-toast__close { margin-left: auto; align-self: flex-start; border: 0; background: none; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; padding: 0 2px; }
  @keyframes tt-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
</style>
<script src="https://true-b.vercel.app/true-tribute-try.js" defer></script>
